WEBVTT

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:01.760
Ruki-kun...

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:05.730
How did this happen?

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:08.480
He... protected me.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:13.320
Because of me, Ruki...

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.450
It's not your fault, Azusa-kun.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:19.590
It couldn't be helped 
under the circumstances.

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.570
It was too sudden.

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:33.710
What the hell are they?!

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:04.300
Ruki!

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:11.920
Why did the wolves attack?

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:17.290
I know, it's weird. But we have no idea, either.

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:25.960
Ruki-kun...

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.270
To tell the truth...

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:33.940
Ruki-kun had been acting weird lately.

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:37.290
He's been under a lot of pressure.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.090
All for that plan...

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:40.440
You mean...

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:44.320
The "Apple of Adam" plan.

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:48.620
One of us will awaken as "Adam."

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.800
To do that, we needed Eve's blood.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:55.240
In other words, your blood.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:57.420
My blood...

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:01.640
That's why we kept drinking your blood.

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:03.720
To become Adam.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:08.810
But Ruki started to feel pressured because

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:12.500
he didn't feel any sign of the awakening.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:21.690
Why? What's going on, Ruki-kun?

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:26.200
So that's why...

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:30.400
But his actions show how determined

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:32.830
he was to become Adam.

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:35.430
Ruki-kun has always

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:39.090
prioritized the plan above all else.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:44.870
And... it's because of Ruki...

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:46.500
that we...

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:52.300
We spent most of our lives suffering,

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:56.610
but when the four of us were together...

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:08.120
We had good times, as well.

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:12.630
We did.

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:00.250
Ruki-kun.

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.480
What are you doing here?

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:08.250
I heard you got hurt, and I was worried...

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:12.140
Who the hell do you think 
you are to worry about me?

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:14.350
Don't bother.

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:18.540
I heard about the plan.

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:21.600
The "Apple of Adam" plan.

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:23.900
Shut up.

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:25.200
Why?

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:29.090
You were trying to become Adam, right?

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:30.980
I told you to shut up.

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:34.890
If you're worried about that,

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:36.660
don't hold everything in.

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:39.090
You should at least talk to the others...

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:41.170
What good will talking do?

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:44.420
Nothing will change.

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:46.950
But—

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:48.170
It won't change!

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:54.260
We can't be Adam. None of us can.

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:08.790
We needed to accomplish this plan 
for <i>him</i>, no matter what it took.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:14.750
That's why we needed your blood.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:18.600
But I eventually realized something.

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:23.750
No matter how much of your blood 
I take, nothing will change.

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:26.870
I cannot be awakened.

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:32.790
So I've reached a conclusion.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:39.060
We non-purebloods cannot become Adam.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:46.360
Only pureblood vampires are 
given the right to be Adam.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:54.030
You don't need to know about that.

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:59.510
In the first place, I doubt they'll 
be able to carry out their plan.

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:04.170
Funny, right?

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:08.450
In other words,

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:12.700
we were trying to achieve something 
impossible from the start.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:20.230
There's no way I can tell them that.

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:24.370
You think so?

00:08:25.490 --> 00:08:26.720
It's possible that

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:31.490
they've actually figured it out already.

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:37.100
That you've been struggling on your 
own because you can't be Adam.

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.600
They all told me

00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:55.600
how you always put them first.

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:11.070
Ruki-kun.

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:16.840
To think I've been cheered up by livestock.

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:21.640
That's true...

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:26.130
If we don't discard the possibility, maybe...

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:33.020
Ruki-kun.

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:45.600
I don't understand you.

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:49.980
Is it because you're Eve?

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:55.110
Stay that way.

00:09:57.560 --> 00:10:01.120
You're my Eve, and mine alone.

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:04.520
Stay with me.

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:25.370
Lunar eclipse.

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:30.150
The power of us Founders will reach its peak.

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:34.180
Vampires are sensitive to the waning moon,

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:36.260
so their powers will be at their weakest.

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:40.230
I'm so excited, I'm trembling!

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:42.160
Patience, Shin.

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:47.110
The first thing we must do is
claim that woman's blood.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:49.850
Everything else comes after that.

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:51.400
I know that.

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:54.670
The time has come,

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:55.850
brother.

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:57.320
Yes.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:02.550
Then let us go.

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:06.060
Let the vengeance begin.

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:15.520
For the future of the Founders!

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:18.900
After all these years... Now is the time!

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:26.030
With the lunar eclipse, the seal 
that held us is, at last, undone.

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:29.960
We'll use this blade called 
vengeance against them.

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:32.790
We who inherited the First Blood...

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:35.430
...shall take everything with our fangs.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:38.360
Let's begin the festival...

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.900
...which we call "annihilation."
